{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Child</strong> is a first-person survival horror game set in a dark atmosphere. Find a way out of a deserted apartment complex before the child finds you. You are being hunted, and your life depends on your decisions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/36895fa93f88824dc68012ca81de9cdb.avif?t=1761501673\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras_big/36895fa93f88824dc68012ca81de9cdb.avif?t=1761501673 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell asleep in front of the TV, as you do most nights. But as you wake up this time, nothing is as usual. You are a resident in a big apartment complex, and now it seems you are the only one left. Something really bad must be going on. All exits are barricaded. Someone tried to lock something inside the building. Someone tried to contain it. And you are trapped with it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival and finding an exit route. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues and tools to defeat the Child and escape this nightmare. Keep an eye out for every possible hiding spot on your way. When it is hunting, there is little time to make the right decisions. Stay away from the vents, and always lock your apartment door behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized elements, so every playthrough feels different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter, so be careful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal HUD for maximal immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vicious AI that reacts to every step you take </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.poster.avif?t=1761501673\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.webm?t=1761501673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.mp4?t=1761501673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and stay safe!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357120?t=1761501673","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761501673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/cd9ae1da9c73e27e11d3c993940267bfe897dc3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761501673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/cd9ae1da9c73e27e11d3c993940267bfe897dc3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761501673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Child</strong> is a first-person survival horror game set in a dark atmosphere. Find a way out of a deserted apartment complex before the child finds you. You are being hunted, and your life depends on your decisions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/36895fa93f88824dc68012ca81de9cdb.avif?t=1761501673\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras_big/36895fa93f88824dc68012ca81de9cdb.avif?t=1761501673 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell asleep in front of the TV, as you do most nights. But as you wake up this time, nothing is as usual. You are a resident in a big apartment complex, and now it seems you are the only one left. Something really bad must be going on. All exits are barricaded. Someone tried to lock something inside the building. Someone tried to contain it. And you are trapped with it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival and finding an exit route. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues and tools to defeat the Child and escape this nightmare. Keep an eye out for every possible hiding spot on your way. When it is hunting, there is little time to make the right decisions. Stay away from the vents, and always lock your apartment door behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized elements, so every playthrough feels different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter, so be careful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal HUD for maximal immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vicious AI that reacts to every step you take </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.poster.avif?t=1761501673\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.webm?t=1761501673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.mp4?t=1761501673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and stay safe!</p>","developers":["Gerrit Ammel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/4a0d0020d5d7a1d237509dcc5ad074dffd34f39f/header.jpg?t=1761501673","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357120/841005/ec78d1b58c8a9f5a7413ea5a931acc54f1bd12e2/1750843269/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745312098","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357120/841005/ec78d1b58c8a9f5a7413ea5a931acc54f1bd12e2/1750843269/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745312098","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357120/841005/ec78d1b58c8a9f5a7413ea5a931acc54f1bd12e2/1750843269/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745312098","id":257107740,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107740/397332cb8dacbdde33da9fc575888f744b9b0a6d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745312098"}],"name":"The Child","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Gerrit Ammel"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nAlkohol / Tabak\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/95ae0837c0b8229dc3f26e830ff2b1021a895d26/ss_95ae0837c0b8229dc3f26e830ff